<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρονομ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call with a slight change of name</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.45
			</span></i> :— 
				Pass.
			, <i>have one's name slightly changed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.1.15
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀκτικὴν τὴν νῦν Ἀττικὴν
					παρονομασθεῖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.1.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b><i>form a
				derived name</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν καινὰ ἔθεσαν, τὰ δὲ
					παρωνόμασαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					11.11.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				97
			</span></i> :— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be named after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωνομασμένον ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.2.15
			</span></i> ; <i>to be derived</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					148.11
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pron.</u>
					3.17
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.1.9
				</span></i>
			 ; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸ παρωνομάσθαι</span>
			because of <i>the employment of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρονομασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ Τύχῃ τὴν ἀνδρείαν παρωνόμασεν</span>
			<i>added the epithet 'virilis' to 'Fortuna'</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.318f
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
